<title>
“AIR BAG” Warning Light Check
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Set ignition “ON”.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Check that “AIR BAG” warning light (1) is on for 6 seconds. If “AIR BAG” warning light is not on, refer to 
<intxref refid = "AENLSB0A8204010">“AIR BAG” Warning Light Does Not Come ON</intxref>
. If “AIR BAG” warning light is kept ON and no DTC is detected in SDM, refer to 
<intxref refid = "AENLSB0A8204009">“AIR BAG” Warning Light Comes ON Steady</intxref>
.
</ptxt>
